// Calls this function.
//
// @link https://r4to0.github.io/asautodocs/docs/Function.htm
ReturnValue@ Call(?& in, ?& in, ?& in, ?& in);
// Calls this function.
//
// @link https://r4to0.github.io/asautodocs/docs/Function.htm
ReturnValue@ Call(?& in, ?& in, ?& in, ?& in, ?& in);
// Calls this function.
//
// @link https://r4to0.github.io/asautodocs/docs/Function.htm
ReturnValue@ Call(?& in, ?& in, ?& in, ?& in, ?& in, ?& in);
// Calls this function.
//
// @link https://r4to0.github.io/asautodocs/docs/Function.htm
ReturnValue@ Call(?& in, ?& in, ?& in, ?& in, ?& in, ?& in, ?& in);
// Calls this function.
